lsh","James DiStefano","Frankie J. Allison","Tangelia Rouse","William Christian","Wayne Lopez","Nicole Mansour","Jonny Acker","Danny Cistone","Cody Estes","Nicolas Roye","T.J. Beacom","Frank Crim","Scott Cummins","Richard Dyer","Howard Mann","India King","Charlie Stewart","Magic Johnson","Sheila Shaw","Bob Glouberman","Chane't Johnson","Jodi Carlisle","Henry Gibson","Richard Penn","Rick Hall","Darlene Kardon","Malachi Pearson","Frederick Dawson","Marcy Goldman","Christel Khalil","Chad Brannon","Joey Gray","Skip O'Brien","Aaron Brumfield","Curtis Williams","Ken Daly","Donald Sage Mackay","Carlo Manchini","Robert Thomas Preston","Adam Cagley","Robin Krieger","Bobby Block","Jonathan Hernandez","James McCauley","Tina Gasbarra","Elijah Runcorn","Eric Payne","Donna Pieroni","Ajgie Kirkland","Wesley Thompson","Todd Eckert","Dennis Napolitano","Ashley Gardner","Jason Huber","David Bickford","Jeff Bowser","Cathrine Grace","Cisco Reyes","Maura Soden","Jonathan Craig Williams","Michael Kagan","Lisa Lewolt","Scotch Ellis Loring","Stewart Skelton","Fiona Hale","Andrea Silvers","Kathryn Melton","Klee Bragger","Miles Marsico","Steve Kramer","Margie Loomis","Antoinette Byron","Michael Rothhaar","Jeff Braine","Peter Siragusa","Liann Pattison","Heather McDonald","Brooks McBeth","Patrick O'Connor","Ted Giannoulas","Evan Sabara","Jesse Bostick","Alastair Shearman","Nick Toth","Eric Marquette","Nike Doukas","Alex Morris","John Valdetero","Helaine Lembeck","Dakota Fanning","Robert Loggia","Devin Sidell","Mark DeCarlo","David Doty","John Harrington Bland","Victoria Stevens","Yolanda Snowball","Reid Collums","Angela Little","Mary Gillis","Robert Grovich","Joe Ochman","Michelle Davison","Barry Sigismondi","Marco Gould","Cody Arens","Easton Gage","Steven Houska","Larry Marko","Howard George","Garret Davis"],"screenwriters":["Jack Amiel","Michael Begler","Eric Kaplan","Nahnatchka Khan","Rob Ulin","Michael Borkow","Andy Bobrow","Alex Reid","Dan Kopelman","David Wright","Andrew Orenstein","Linwood Boomer","Bob Stevens","Michael Glouberman","Maggie Bandur","Matthew Carlson","Alan J. Higgins","Gary Murphy","Rob Hanning","Neil Thompson","Ian Busch","Larry Strawther"],"cinematographers":["Michael Weaver","Levie Isaacks","Victor Hammer"],"composers":["Charles Sydnor"],"reviews":[{"author":"Kozy9","text":"Skrytý poklad medzi západniarskymi seriálmi. Malcolm sa navonok tvári ako vhodný kandidát na kulisu spríjemňujúcu nedelňajšieho šlofíka, no v skutku ponúka geniálny pohľad na teoreticky reálnu, prakticky úplne nemožnú rodinu. Narozdiel od ostatných rodinných seriálov tvorcovia o niečo pritvrdili a aj napriek skutočnosti, že stredobodom je mladý chalan, seriálu sa darí udržať si aj dospelého diváka. Jednoducho si po pár častiach Malcolma úplne zamilujete a budete nútený ho dopozerať až dokonca. A keď už nič iné, tak vás určite dostanú herecké výkony Cranstona či dokonalej Jane Kaczmarek. CELKOVÉ HODNOTENIE: 90%. KÚPIŤ NA BD/DVD: Malcolm postrádza hlbšiu pointu a taktiež so sebou nenesie strhújici odkaz, ale svojim špecifickým čarom, ktoré nemusí vyhovovať každému vie pobaviť celú rodinu.(01.06.2014)","stars":5},{"author":"veru_needy","text":"Je to taková ta rodinná bláznivá komedie, kde se většinu času jen řve na děti, máma má výbuchy vzteku, táta to všechno žehlí, děti to všechno i tak vyhrotí a sem tam se pobavíme nebo pousmějeme nad nějakým hezkým momentem. Je to prostě klasika, kterou jsem si nechtěla nechat ujít. Oblíbenou postavu asi nemám, ale pokud bych měla tleskat za roli, vyhrála by to Lois. -\"Fate is just what you call it when you don't know the name of the person screwing you over.\"(18.05.2018)","stars":5},{"author":"Blazkowicz","text":"Další z řady seriálů, který jsem si jako malý kluk oblíbil. Pro tento jsem měl několik důvodů. Americká rodinka z přelomu tisíciletí, na začátku hraje nějaký punk rock nebo alternativní rock a Francis vypadá jako jeden týpek od nás z ulice. Nikdy jsem to ale neviděl pořádně celé a tentokrát to nebude jiné. Dabing končí s druhou sérií a ta nejde sehnat ani celá, takže končím s první. Beru to spíš jako takový exkurz do dětství. Ale líbilo se mi to i teď. 4-*(21.08.2024)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-ca1ac46e-9883-4125-a6e8-97efce9a2bf5"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/70662-malcolm-v-nesnazich/prehled/","csfd_id":70662,"root_id":70662,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":7,"episode_count":151,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}